## DICOM Mock Server Configurations
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Get Remote Auto Push Status
GET {{graphServer}}/api/v1/scp/auto-push

### Configure Remote Auto Push
POST {{graphServer}}/api/v1/scp/auto-push
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "intervalSec": 30,
  "targetAeTitle": "GOSMART_GS",
  "targetHost": "127.0.0.1",
  "targetPort": 11112
}

### Disable Remote Auto Push
POST {{graphServer}}/api/v1/scp/auto-push
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "intervalSec": 30,
  "targetAeTitle": "GOSMART_GS",
  "targetHost": "127.0.0.1",
  "targetPort": 11112
}

